experiment: aimfloor
  instrument        aimfloor   trial seed 0000000001358638   6 creatures
                    another probe is another trial sequence: its numbers
                    are not comparable with these (~0.05 at 300 trials)
  the question      is the 13 Hz within-target sd a property of the
                    PLANT or of the STATISTIC? It reads ~13 in every
                    arm that has a sustained bias and ~21 in every
                    arm that does not, across nine arms.
  why it matters    aimhold and aimpool refused feedback on that
                    number, at a gain that was DERIVED and never
                    optimised. A two-level statistic cannot grade
                    precision.

